001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    TINVPSWD.
001300 AUTHOR.        LS BAKER.
001500 INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.  APRIL 4, 1984.
001600
001700*REMARKS.       INVOICE PROCESSING.
001800*               THIS IS THE MAINTENANCE PROGRAM FOR INVOICE
001900*               PROCESSING EMPLOYEE PASSWORDS.  IT DOES THE
002000*               FOLLOWING:
002100*                    1.  ADDS A PASSWORD ENTRY.
002200*                    2.  CHANGES A PASSWORD ENTRY.
002300*                    3.  DELETES A PASSWORD ENTRY.
002400*                    4.  INQUIRES ABOUT A PASSWORD ENTRY.
002410*
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  11/17/1997     CA YODER
      *C     INCREASED PASSWORD SIZE FROM 6 TO 7 SO THAT USERS CAN USE
      *C     THEIR 7-CHARACTER MAINFRAME PASSWORD.
      *C
      *C  03/12/1998     CA YODER
      *C     INCREASED PASSWORD SIZE FROM 7 TO 8 AFTER FINDING OUT THAT
      *C     THE MAINFRAME PASSWORD IS 8 CHARACTERS.

002600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT INVPWFIL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFL000201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT INVPWFIL-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFL000201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003000
003100 DATA DIVISION.
003200 FILE SECTION.
       FD  INVPWFIL-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  INVPWFIL-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFL000201.
       FD  INVPWFIL-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  INVPWFIL-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFL000201.
003300
003400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X VALUE SPACES.
9406CK 01  SCOPE   PIC X.

       COPY DATAB   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
